== Super Special Rocks {{dlc+|a+}} ==
[[File:Repentance super special rocks.png|448px]]

Super Special Rocks are Tinted Rock variants whose smaller marks and lack of discoloration make them much harder to spot. Super Special Rocks take two bombs to blow up and drop the contents of two Tinted Rocks, with the exception that a single chest or {{i|The Small Rock}} appear without extra rewards.
<!-- it's been claimed here that a super special rock always drops the small rock if it's not been generated, but seed LLMEDLKT, 1 north 1 east from start disproves it -->

Only one super special rock can spawn per room, and normal tinted rocks cannot appear in the same room.

In [[Chapter 4]] and [[Chapter 4.5]], Super Special Rocks are almost identical to Tinted Rocks, making them easier to spot in these chapters.

Super Special Rocks are unlocked by the achievement {{a|5 Nights at Mom's}}, which requires getting a 5-win streak, using a different character each time. {{dlc|rnr+}} This number can be reduced to 3; see [[Achievements#Notes|the Notes section of the Achievements page]].

