== Marked Skulls {{dlc+|r}} ==
[[File:Tinted_Skull.png|50px]]

Act like [[#Rocks|rock]]s.

* Unlocked by: {{achievement unlock|A Strange Door}}

Once unlocked, a single skull marked with a small "x" will appear in {{s|Depths}}, {{s|Necropolis}}, and {{s|Dank Depths}} II or XL. When destroyed, it will drop {{P|0 - The Fool}}.
* If Isaac has {{I|Little Baggy}}, it will drop an identified [[Pills|Telepill]]. If Isaac also has {{I|False PHD}}, it will drop an identified [[Pills|???]] pill.

=== Notes ===
* Cannot be re-rolled by {{I|D12}}.
* Marked Skulls may spawn in {{R|Red Room}}s on {{s|Depths}}, {{s|Necropolis}}, and {{s|Dank Depths}}, even while not in the II or XL floor. They can also appear in Red Rooms in {{s|The Void}} based on rooms from those floors.
* Marked Skulls have different appearances when spawned on other floors, e.g. manually via the console or during the [[DELETE THIS]] challenge. Some of these are [[Cut Content]] from the original game.
** For example, it will appear as a white urn in {{s|Basement}}, as a red mushroom in {{s|Caves}}, or a horizontally flipped polyp in {{s|Womb}}.
** It will appear as a regular bucket in {{s|Dross}} with no visual difference.
